[CA]
RESOLUTION - Re-appropriating the Fiscal Year 2016 budget of the City of Cheyenne
according to the provisions of W.S. §16-4-112 and 16-4-113.  Motion (per Consent Agenda) carried.
(#5712)
RESOLUTION - Authorizing the Mayor and the City Clerk to sign a Final Plat for Saddle
Ridge, 8 Filing, a portion of the E½ of Section 25, T.14N., R.66W., 6 P.M., Cheyenne, Wyoming
th
th
(located north of and adjacent to E. Pershing Boulevard, west of Christensen Road).  Mr. Shanor
